            "text": "The function tip makes a .call() call and does not use the bool it returns, so a failed call goes unnoticed. Fix: Use the bool the call returns (require it, or branch on it), or use a library call that reverts for you. Do not rely on transfer or send to be enough gas for a recipient that is a contract."
